      "bsm_10": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_11",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"Friends! Neighbours! Ratepayers! The business before us is SHORT and the afternoon is LONG!\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_11": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_12",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "The crowd laughs on cue. Some of them are a beat late and you can see which ones.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_12": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_13",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "The Clerk says, \"A written amendment, Captain. From the gentleman in the third row.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_13": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 400
        },
        "next": "bsm_14",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"An AMENDMENT! Splendid! The system WORKS!\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_14": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 400
        },
        "duration_s": 6,
        "graphic_id": "",
        "next": "bsm_15",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "subtext": "ONE MOMENT LATER",
        "text": "THE THIRD ROW",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_15": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_16",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "A man stands up. He's the only person in the hall shot in close-up, which in a Directorate picture isn't a compliment.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_16": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_17",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "The Amender says, \"I move that the meter clause be struck.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_17": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_18",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"The gentleman moves that the meter clause be struck! Is the motion SECONDED?\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_18": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_19",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "A long pan across two hundred people, none of whom move.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_19": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 560
        },
        "next": "bsm_20",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"The motion FAILS for want of a second! Next business!\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_2": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 80
        },
        "graphic_id": "captain_quorum_title",
        "next": "bsm_3",
        "type": "title_card"
      },
      "bsm_20": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_21",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "Twenty-one seconds. There's a stopwatch on the print and the Directorate was proud of it.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_21": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 720
        },
        "duration_s": 8,
        "next": "bsm_22",
        "overlayType": "act_card",
        "subtext": "The Gentleman Persists",
        "text": "ACT 2",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_22": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 720
        },
        "duration_s": 6,
        "graphic_id": "",
        "next": "bsm_23",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "subtext": "THE FOLLOWING WEEK",
        "text": "THE CIVIC HALL",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_23": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_24",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "The same hall. The same bunting. The same man, standing up again.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_24": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 720
        },
        "next": "bsm_25",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "The Amender says, \"I move that the meter clause be struck.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_25": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_26",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"Is the motion SECONDED?\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_26": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_27",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "Nobody moves. Except, at the very back of frame, in the corner, out of focus, somebody's hand.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_27": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_28",
        "style": "ambient",
        "text": "♪ The fanfare tries to start and stops. ♪",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_28": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 880
        },
        "next": "bsm_29",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"... I'm sorry?\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_29": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 880
        },
        "duration_s": 6,
        "graphic_id": "",
        "next": "bsm_30",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "subtext": "THE WEEK AFTER THAT",
        "text": "THE CIVIC HALL",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_3": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 80
        },
        "next": "bsm_4",
        "style": "ambient",
        "text": "♪ A brass fanfare in municipal green. Six bars. It'll be back. ♪",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_30": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_31",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "Four hands.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_31": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "duration_s": 6,
        "graphic_id": "",
        "next": "bsm_32",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "subtext": "THE WEEK AFTER THAT",
        "text": "THE CIVIC HALL",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_32": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_33",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "Forty.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_33": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "duration": 6,
        "next": "bsm_34",
        "type": "tech_difficulties"
      },
      "bsm_34": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1040
        },
        "next": "bsm_35",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "REEL TWO IS DAMAGED on every surviving print, always at the same place, which the collectors' consensus holds isn't a coincidence and the archivists' consensus holds is a bad splice. Both parties have written at length.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_35": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "duration_s": 40,
        "next": "bsm_36",
        "overlayType": "intermission",
        "subtext": "",
        "text": "INTERMISSION",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_36": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "duration_s": 8,
        "next": "bsm_37",
        "overlayType": "act_card",
        "subtext": "The Motion Carries",
        "text": "ACT 3",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_37": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "duration_s": 6,
        "graphic_id": "",
        "next": "bsm_38",
        "overlayType": "lower_third",
        "subtext": "LATE",
        "text": "THE CIVIC HALL",
        "type": "overlay"
      },
      "bsm_38": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_39",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "The hall is dark except for the dais. QUORUM is alone at the lectern with the gavel in front of him and doesn't pick it up.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_39": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1200
        },
        "next": "bsm_40",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"Clerk. How many.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_4": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 80
        },
        "next": "bsm_5",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "The print is immaculate. That's the first thing anybody notices and the last thing anybody forgets: eighty years on, this stock is better than anything the basin has made since, and the greens are still green.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_40": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_41",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "The Clerk says, \"All of them, Captain.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_41": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_42",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"That isn't a number.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_42": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_43",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "The Clerk says, \"No, Captain.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_43": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_44",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "He straightens his sash. The costume department made four of those and this is the last one, and it's visibly the last one.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_44": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1360
        },
        "next": "bsm_45",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"Then the motion is seconded.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_45": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_46",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"And the motion is DEBATED.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_46": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_47",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"And the motion, having been debated —\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_47": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_48",
        "style": "narration",
        "text": "He picks up the gavel. The Directorate's animation unit put a starburst behind this shot and it's the single most expensive frame in the picture.",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_48": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_49",
        "style": "verbatim",
        "text": "Captain Quorum says, \"— CARRIES.\"",
        "type": "say"
      },
      "bsm_49": {
        "_vine": {
          "x": 960,
          "y": 1520
        },
        "next": "bsm_50",
        "style": "ambient",
        "text": "♪ The fanfare, at last, all six bars, and about a tone flat. ♪",
        "type": "say"
      },
